{"parse": {"title": "RGS-15", "pageid": 146440, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/RGS-14\" title=\"RGS-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RGS-15</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RGS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">15</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.84.BF.E4.BD.A0.EF.BC.8C.E7.A5.9D.E4.BD.A0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"愿你，祝你\">愿你，祝你</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 愿你，祝你</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">With Best Wishes</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>萨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>卡<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3910115</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-3_9_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-3_9_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-3_9_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>火山岛水上竞技比赛在此落下帷幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>赛事的成绩、胜负已一一揭晓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>公正的裁判声音比以往更富有情感，宣示一场不同寻常的赛事的结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>双方已完成公正契约，赫多涅殿下亦不再受契约的束缚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>在此，我们也将共同见证——桂冠不再只为一人加冕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>维尔汀，今日你作为胜者，我会为你履行我的承诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>君主扬起一只手，周围升起强烈的光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>满地黄金与宝藏环绕，像隐秘而巨大的宝库倾泻而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我曾为家族的商船护航，也曾潜入海的最深处寻得传闻中的秘宝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>而我从不吝于与我的挚友共享这宝藏与财富！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>维尔汀，尽情拥有它们吧，作为挚友的证明，也作为你胜利的桂冠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被簇拥在闪闪发光的财宝中间，几乎无处下脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>赫多涅殿下，感谢您的馈赠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但是，我并非为这样的财富而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不是吧？！维尔汀，你该不会一个子儿都不要吧……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>有了这些钱，至少我和APPLe先生就再也不用填船只保养资金的申请表格了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>虽然在基金会申请资金需要走一些程序，但最后总会到账的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>话是这么说没错……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宝藏的辉光最终还是没有留住离开它们的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这些财富不是我们迫切需要的东西，在岛外当下的情形下，我们更看重的是能够相互信任的伙伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>如此看来，你已经拥有很多了，维尔汀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，领袖的挚友清楚这个事实，也为此感到愉快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>不过——代表胜利的桂冠总是必要的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>来吧！维尔汀，总该收下点什么，纪念这胜利！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_17.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_17\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_17\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_9_bg_17.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_17.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_9_bg_17.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_17.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_9_bg_17.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_17.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-315715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-315715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-315715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>……就没人想把桂冠给我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙闷闷不乐地趴在吧台上。她摊开手心，那里静静躺着一根断开的银链……原本应该还有一枚闪烁光辉的鳞片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她曾经把它攥在手里很久很久，像攥住一注免费的好运、一个从天而降的奇迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她回想着把鳞片扔掉那一刻的心情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>开辟一条可以在岩浆上奔跑的道路，简直像天方夜谭一样……只有那枚鳞片能做到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>纳西索斯，就算没有桂冠，你也可以举着这根链子——虽然不知道它是什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>举……一根银链？可是为什么啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>因为我们每个人都是冠军，冠军都该在庆祝的时候举点什么，遗憾的是，你们的裁判事先只准备了一顶桂冠！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>算了……反正我承认维尔汀值得那顶唯一的桂冠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海盗没有继续这个话题，只是向她挥了挥手上熟悉的空玻璃杯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这是我的，呃，冠军奖杯！不错吧，阿波罗送的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>虽然我也很想要赫多涅的那一大堆财宝，但是在黄金和宝藏中选择玻璃杯——没什么比这个更摇滚了，阿波罗很懂嘛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>对了，他们给十四行诗准备的礼物也非常有意思——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在她身旁，第一助手略显局促地举着一张黄金制成的扑克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>荷米斯说……这是赢牌的奖励。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每位参与者都得到了属于自己的纪念品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>唔……起码我收获了一段特别的回忆，我还认识了你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>这就是我的收获，这已经足够了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拍拍自己的肩膀，像以往一样为自己打气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声传来，她立刻转过头去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有光芒在她眼睛中闪烁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想，这个桂冠应该属于你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>维、维、维……维……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>轮船驾驶室呼叫船员纳西索斯！还在吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽责的星锑船长笑着呼唤她的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>维尔汀，可是它……它不是赫多涅送给你的……胜利的象征吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>“神谕”不是曾经说过，我们会为你带来胜利吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你一直相信的事情没有错，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的宁芙惊讶得说不出完整的话，她心跳加速，呼吸急促，吐出的话全都变了调。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>呃……呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>哇——！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她扑向她寻来的岛外英雄，大哭了起来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_33.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_33\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_33\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_9_at_33.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_33.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_9_at_33.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_33.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_9_at_33.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_33.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巨大的欢呼盖住了所有的笑声和哭声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>维尔汀，你很有英雄风范嘛——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>举着酒杯的领袖开怀大笑，揽住挚友的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我为你调了无酒精鸡尾酒，庆祝你的胜利！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>谢谢您，赫多涅殿下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>哇……呜呜呜哇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>好了，好了，纳西索斯，不要再哭了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>狂欢的时候不需要眼泪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>可是，可是我忍不住……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>而且，火山岛没有规定狂欢的时候不能哭……就算是赫多涅说的也不算数！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>纳西索斯小姐，我这里有手帕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>那算了！我也给你调一杯无酒精饮料吧，听好了，这是专属于你们俩的殊荣！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>可我已经能喝真正的酒了，赫多涅！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哈哈哈哈哈……确实，毕竟你的年纪比我轮回的这一世都要大了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>什么——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>纳西索斯，你究竟多少岁了？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船长震惊的声音差点穿透了酒吧的天花板。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_18.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_18\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_18\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_9_bg_18.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_9_bg_18.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_18.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_9_bg_18.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_18.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对荷米斯而言，这实在是非常不走运的一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他看看对面的阿波罗与忒弥斯，又看看眼前的赫多涅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>……嗨？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315618.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-315618.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315618.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315618.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-315618.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315618.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-315618.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315618.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>嗨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅漫不经心地点头，身侧镶嵌着宝石的金色酒杯中，蜂蜜色的美酒散发着甜香。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>你们……在玩牌？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>显然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>裁判又打出了一张牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>那……我能一起吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315618.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-315618.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315618.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315618.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-315618.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315618.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-315618.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315618.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>当然，我马上就走了，你可以坐我的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>领袖面无表情地把手牌扔在桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-315614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-315614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-315614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>怎么，最后一局，就没人愿意让让我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>唉，殿下，您也知道，一切形式的作弊在火山岛都是被禁止的嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>——我可以！我愿意作弊！我愿意让殿下赢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>天啊，纳西索斯已经走了，如果您也走了的话……我就只能和他们玩皮诺克了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-653210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>我从来没在他们那里赢过！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>丝毫不顾信使朋友的苦苦哀求，铁石心肠的岛主站了起来，拿起酒杯一饮而尽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>放心，我的朋友们——我还会回来的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_9_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_9_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_9_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>……真是惊心动魄的假期啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大副终于找回了他的船长，以及旅途中失散的水手朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处，X悠闲地躺在沙滩布上，拿起小小的装饰用遮阳伞，品尝鸡尾酒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸信圈儿和两位优雅的乐手则站在洁白的沙滩上，似乎正与粉色的海兽进行一场愉快的会面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>对了，维尔汀小姐，你的留言和平乌鲁女士收到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>她似乎已经迫不及待地开始策划下一届水上运动会了，委托我向你表达谢意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>此外，这里还有一些来自基金会的日常工作信件，不过，目前没有特别紧急的事务需要我们处理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>需要APPLe某现在将这些信读出来吗，诸位？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>如果不紧急的话，还是迟些再念吧，大副！本船长可是刚刚结束一场伟大冒险，终于回归沙滩躺椅的怀抱之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我要想方设法延续这度假的乐趣！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她获得了一份意料之外的赞同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>星锑说得对。我们毕竟正在……度假。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苹果了然地抖了抖领结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>非常合理的诉求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>那就说些无关公务的事……咳咳，诸位还记得在被纳西索斯小姐拉下船之前，我们在讨论什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>呃，黏糊糊的海怪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是英雄奥德修斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>对，此时此刻，倘若诸位没有异议，APPLe某倒是很想念一首关于他的诗，作为这次伟大航行的结语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>乐意聆听，APPLe先生。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_03\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_9_at_03.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_9_at_03.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_9_at_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>当你前往伊萨卡，愿你道路漫长，充满奇遇，充满发现。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_18.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_18\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_18\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-3_9_at_18.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-3_9_at_18.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_18.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-3_9_at_18.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_18.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>拉斯忒吕戈涅斯，独眼巨人，或是愤怒的波塞冬——不必惧怕：你绝不会遭遇这些，只要保持高尚的思想，只要弥足珍贵的激情。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_36.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_36\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_36\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_at_36.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_36.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"837\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_at_36.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_36.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_at_36.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_36.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"3616\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>愿你在许多个夏日清晨，带着何等的欢欣、何等的喜悦，驶入初次抵达的海港。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>你必须让伊萨卡长留心中。到伊萨卡去，那里是你命定的归宿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>然而，请不要行路匆匆，这场旅途最好持续多年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>倘若你觉得她贫瘠，我的朋友，伊萨卡从不曾将你愚弄。届时你已有足够的智慧、足够的阅历，你一定会明白，伊萨卡究竟意味着什么。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_23.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_23\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_23\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-3_9_at_23.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_23.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-3_9_at_23.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_23.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-3_9_at_23.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_23.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\"><i><span style=\"color:#F8CE86\">Rekindled! Games of the Summer-Gold Sea<br />                                     重 燃 ！ 流 金 之 海</span></i></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>真是一首优雅的诗歌……嗯？船长？你还在听吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>……维尔汀小姐？十四行诗小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>好吧，在旅途的终点，英雄们当然值得拥有一段优质睡眠。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzinei\"><img alt=\"0xiangzinei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在平平无奇的日子里，总会有一些新朋友为熟悉的日常增添变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>看到了吗？朋友们！你们还不够了解我，我很乐意告诉你们我的事迹……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金色的桂冠在她奋力的挥舞中折射着光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>虽然火山岛的主人实力强劲，不过呢，我和我的队友维尔汀显然更胜一筹！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>在比赛的最后，赫多涅哭着承认——伟大的纳西索斯从一开始就注定得到那胜利！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>于是，这桂冠……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她滔滔不绝，添油加醋，如痴如醉讲述着属于她的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她并不知道，一分钟以后，她将听到某个她绝对不愿意听到的声音，并且为此发出今天的第一声尖叫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>又见面了，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她微笑着按住纳西索斯的头顶，缓缓让她面向自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>很抱歉，我来晚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你可以从头开始，再给我讲一讲这个故事吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RGS-15"}}